      <slug></slug>
      <title>GPRBuild - A New Build Tool for Large-Scale Software Development</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Ada</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;GPRBuild is a Free (GPL) modern multi-language builder from AdaCore.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It is a configurable tool that is able to drive a large number of tool chains, both native and cross, of many languages, such as Ada, C, C++, Fortran, Assembler, etc.  With GPRBuild, you are able to build systems written in one or several languages, with the main program in any language.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;GPRBuild (re)compiles sources, (re)builds libraries and (re)links executables.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="231">Vincent Celier</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>